#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:15 44f67ebdee764c3da5d923766fbab967
msgid "This article explains how to set up Rover using the APM2.x autopilot."
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用 APM2.x 飞控设置 Rover。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:18 69c1c3ffa2b24ef3bf9c22e982bcef7f
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:20 9c282c5f555d4880a480d19cda832f97
msgid ""
"The process of converting an RC car to a Rover consists of adding an "
"autopilot board in between the RC receiver and the car's motor and steering "
"servo. We recommend that the controller be powered by the included Power "
"Module."
msgstr ""
"将 RC 遥控车改装为 Rover 的过程，是在 RC 接收机与车辆电机及转向舵机之间加入自动驾驶飞控板。我们建议使用随附的电源模块为控制器供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:27 f9b5d9bda9a04447887d660b8c1f6d18
msgid ""
"This tutorial assumes you're using a Mode 2 radio setup. If you're using "
"Mode 1, the throttle will move to the other stick"
msgstr "本教程假设使用模式 2 遥控配置。如果使用模式 1，油门将移至另一摇杆。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:30 0504210e0ddc4184a62edcfe4361a148
msgid ""
"Rover is designed to use regular RC transmitters (not specialized RC car "
"transmitters) with both throttle and steering on the right stick in Mode 1 "
"or left stick in Mode 2 - typically the elevator stick. This is because RC "
"cars can typically go both forwards and backwards and so the throttle should"
" be spring-loaded to return to the mid-point. If however, you are not using "
"a RC car motor controller (ESC) but rather a regular aircraft motor "
"controller (ESC), which typically does not have a reverse function, you can "
"put the throttle on the left stick as would normally be the case for an "
"aircraft."
msgstr ""
"Rover 设计用于普通 RC 发射机（而非专用 RC 遥控车发射机），模式 1 下油门和转向均在右摇杆，模式 2 "
"下在左摇杆——通常为升降舵摇杆。这是因为 RC 遥控车通常可前进和后退，因此油门应带弹簧复位至中点。但如果您使用的不是 RC "
"遥控车电调而是普通航模电调（通常无倒车功能），则可将油门置于左摇杆，与普通飞机的操作方式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:44 775f83e69a2b4b358f69eddc5520143b
msgid "Powering Rover"
msgstr "为 Rover 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:46 72c36722e2bf44c9b84be2cd3e76ccc3
msgid ""
"The easiest way to power the APM2.x is using a :ref:`3DR Power Module "
"<common-3dr-power-module>` with a LiPo battery."
msgstr ""
"为 APM2.x 供电最简便的方法是使用 :ref:`3DR 电源模块 <common-3dr-power-module>` 配合 LiPo 电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:48 eef8f8b057dc40f4b09d4f547805c36a
msgid ""
"The Power Module will not power servos and other peripherals. For more "
"information/alternatives see :ref:`Powering the APM2 <common-powering-the-"
"apm2>`."
msgstr ""
"电源模块不会为舵机和其他外设供电。更多信息/替代方案请参阅 :ref:`为 APM2 供电 <common-powering-the-apm2>`。"

