#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:92 6148853e96ae43728ff8bcae832ecc9e
msgid "Installing it in your car"
msgstr "安装到您的车辆上"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:94 d8ed38f6ba024f52a6944fe31ee0b314
msgid ""
"The below shows a typical setup in a small rover, using APM2.x, 3DR radio "
"telemetry and both sonar and IR sensors (instructions on setting them up are"
" :ref:`here <sonar-sensors>`. Note a few elements:"
msgstr ""
"下图展示了小型 Rover 的典型安装，使用 APM2.x、3DR 数传电台以及声呐和红外传感器（设置说明见 :ref:`此处 <sonar-"
"sensors>`）。请注意以下几点："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:98 5991d6fe68f042e283216829abf9a249
msgid ""
"The RC car's plastic body shell has been removed and a plywood sheet cut and"
" drilled to fit on the mounting posts."
msgstr "已拆除 RC 遥控车的塑料车身外壳，切割并钻孔胶合板以适配安装柱。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:100 e333941774244bdea96bd251255373c7
msgid ""
"APM2.x has been raised up on a platform made of four *30mm nylon spacers*, "
"four *5mm nylon screws*,  and a *Copter stack-up plate*. This is to ensure "
"that the sensitive compass sensor on APM is as far as possible from the "
"magnetic noise/interference of the car's electric motor."
msgstr ""
"APM2.x 通过四个 *30mm 尼龙隔柱*、四个 *5mm 尼龙螺丝* 和一个 *多旋翼叠层板* 搭建的平台抬高安装，以确保 APM "
"上灵敏的罗盘传感器尽可能远离车辆电机产生的磁噪声/干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:105 b48fa30311b24aafaee7d9b24df879ee
msgid ""
"APM, the GPS, 3DR radio and RC receiver are all powered by the APM Power "
"Module (included with the APM set). The car's steering servo is powered by "
"the car's speed controller. This is the standard setup and doesn't require "
"any special settings or configuration, but for those wondering about power, "
"that's the answer. Among other advantages, the use of the APM Power Module "
"means that APM can do voltage and current sensing and report battery status "
"to the Ground Station during the run, as well as data log it for after-run "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"APM、GPS、3DR 无线电和 RC 接收机均由 APM 电源模块（含于 APM "
"套装中）供电。车辆转向舵机由车辆的速度控制器供电。这是标准配置，无需任何特殊设置，若您对供电方式有疑问，以上即为答案。使用 APM 电源模块的优势之一是"
" APM 可进行电压和电流检测，在行驶过程中向地面站报告电池状态，并记录数据以供事后分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:113 edaab54a3aa14515a51599dab850c8cb
msgid ""
"A larger battery than the car was originally designed for is being used "
"(because the rover is designed to travel long distances off-road), and it is"
" mounted on velcro under the APM platform so it doesn't shift."
msgstr "使用了比车辆原始设计更大的电池（因为该漫游车被设计用于长距离越野行驶），电池通过魔术贴固定在 APM 平台下方以防移位。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:121 05f8c1546f8744dfa7a7721ef20f06f8
msgid ""
"Depending on the car frame you're using, you may wish to set up your gear "
"differently. Almost any configuration can work, but just remember to keep "
"APM's far from sources of magnetic interference as possible! The image below"
" shows a top view of Tom Coyle's Slash Rover (winner of the Peloton Class at"
" AVC 2013) with a Spektrum receiver, GPS, and external compass."
msgstr ""
"根据您使用的车架，您可能希望采用不同的配置方式。几乎任何配置都可以工作，但请记住，要让 APM 尽可能远离磁干扰源！下图展示了 Tom Coyle 的 "
"Slash Rover（2013 年 AVC 集团赛冠军）的俯视图，配备了 Spektrum 接收机、GPS 和外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:132 c7c0c3dda47e4d7790744cccaf099d66
msgid "3DR GPS uBlox with Onboard Compass"
msgstr "3DR GPS uBlox（带板载罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:134 b558328519a84114bacd7f781507b754
msgid ""
"3DR GPS uBlox with Onboard Compass is intended for use with APM2.x  (for "
"external compass). It provides enhanced compass performance because of the "
"freedom to situate the GPS unit in an optimal position independent of the "
"location of the APM."
msgstr ""
"3DR GPS uBlox（带板载罗盘）适用于 APM2.x（作为外部罗盘）。由于可以将 GPS 单元放置在独立于 APM "
"位置的最佳位置，其罗盘性能得到提升。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:142 e1ba6f7d2d704ecd95ef9896ec27abed
msgid ""
"Place your GPS in an elevated position on your rover with the arrow facing "
"forward (toward the front facing direction of your rover). Connect the GPS "
"module to the APM using the two cables included with the GPS as shown below."
msgstr ""
"将 GPS 放置在漫游车上的较高位置，箭头朝向前方（即漫游车的前进方向）。使用 GPS 附带的两根连接线按下图所示将 GPS 模块连接到 APM。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:150 c36afe4150cf46e2bec02da92d64315f
msgid ""
"3DR GPS uBlox with Onboard Compass includes two connector cables: one "
"4-position cable and one 5-position-to-6-position cable. To connect the GPS "
"module to APM, connect the GPS to the APM GPS port using the 5-position-"
"to-6-position cable; connect the GPS to the APM I2C port using the "
"4-position cable."
msgstr ""
"3DR GPS uBlox（带板载罗盘）包含两根连接线：一根 4 针连接线和一根 5 针转 6 针连接线。将 GPS 模块连接到 APM 时，使用 5 "
"针转 6 针连接线将 GPS 连接到 APM 的 GPS 接口；使用 4 针连接线将 GPS 连接到 APM 的 I2C 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:157 b66fbfcb4654415087c2ef80bb636896
msgid "Slash Rover's GPS with external compass mount:"
msgstr "Slash Rover 的 GPS 及外部罗盘支架："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:163 ae2612f423144e6c878b31c2da1698db
msgid "3DR GPS uBlox without Onboard Compass"
msgstr "3DR GPS uBlox（不带板载罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-apm2-setup.rst:168 b2f08e1573df4168a30f3e17d7f7e7ec
msgid ""
"3DR GPS uBlox without Onboard Compass is intended for use with APM2.x. To "
"install your GPS module without compass, mount to the top of your rover and "
"connect to the APM GPS port using the 5-position-to-6-position connector "
"cable."
msgstr ""
"3DR GPS uBlox（不带板载罗盘）适用于 APM2.x。安装不带罗盘的 GPS 模块时，将其安装在漫游车顶部，并使用 5 针转 6 "
"针连接线连接到 APM 的 GPS 接口。"

